2003-08-25  jvr

	* Lib/fontTools/cffLib.py, Lib/fontTools/t1Lib.py,
	Lib/fontTools/misc/psCharStrings.py: Refactored outline extraction
	for CharStrings. The interface to T{1,2}OutlineExtractor is not
	backwards compatible and this change basically makes them private
	classes: CharStrings now have a .draw() method that takes a Pen
	object (see fontTools.pens.*), so you never have to deal with the
	extractor objects yourself. Only lightly tested.

